#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2655 lib/html.php:2901
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Malunga ne-Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "I-Cacti yenzelwe ukuba ibe sisisombululo esipheleleyo sokuzoba iigrafu esisekelwe kwi-RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) kunye nesisombululo sokuZoba iiGrafu. Injongo yayo kukwenza umsebenzi woMlawuli woThungelwano ube lula ngokukhathalela zonke iinkcukacha ezibalulekileyo eziyimfuneko ukuyila iiGrafu ezinentsingiselo."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Nceda ujonge i-%sIwebhusayithi ye-Cacti%s esemthethweni ukuze ufumane ulwazi malunga nendlela yokusebenzisa i-Cacti, ukufumana inkxaso, kunye nohlaziyo."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Abaphuhlisi abaSebenzayo"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Abaphuhlisi abasebenza kwi-Cacti, kuYakhiwo lwayo, kumaXwebhu kunye nakuKhupho lweXesha elizayo."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Ukukhankanywa ngokuBekekileyo"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Abanikeli kumaXwebhu, kwi-QA, kwi-Packaging, kwiiForam kunye nephepha lethu le-YouTube."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Amalungu aThatha uMhlala-phantsi"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Amalungu eqela lokuqala le-Cacti Group asele edlulele phambili kwimisebenzi yawo. Siyaqhubeka sibanqwenelela okuhle kodwa."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Enkosi"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Umbulelo okhethekileyo ku-%sTobi Oetiker%s, umyili we-%sRRDtool%s kunye ne-%sMRTG%s ethandwa kakhulu."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Abasebenzisi be-Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Ngokukodwa nabani na othathe ixesha lokuyila ingxelo yomcimbi, okanye ngenye indlela wanceda ukulungisa iingxaki ezinxulumene ne-Cacti. Kwakhona nakuye nabani na onikele ekuxhaseni i-Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Ilayisensi"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "I-Cacti inelayisensi phantsi kwe-GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Le program yisoftware ekhululekileyo; ungayisasaza kwakhona kwaye/okanye uyiguqule phantsi kwemiqathango ye-GNU General Public License njengoko ipapashwe yi-Free Software Foundation; nokuba uguqulelo lwesi-2 lweLayisensi, okanye (ngokokhetho lwakho) naluphi na uguqulelo lwamva."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Le program isasazwa ngethemba lokuba iya kuba luncedo, kodwa NGAPHANDLE KWASIPHI NA ISIQINISEKISO; kwanangaphandle kwesiqinisekiso esichaziweyo sokuRHWEBA okanye UKULUNGELA INJONGO ETHILE. Jonga i-GNU General Public License ukufumana iinkcukacha ezithe vetshe."

