#: include/global_form.php:172
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Elona nani likhulu lokuPhindwa kwe-Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php:173
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Kwizixhobo ze-SNMPv2 kunye ne-SNMPv3, ubungakanani be-SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions. Okusisiseko kukuthi 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. Kwii-switch ezinkulu kakhulu, iiseva eziphezulu, ii-Jumbo Frame Networks okanye unxibelelwano lwe-WAN olunokubambezeleka okuphezulu, ukunyusa eli xabiso kunokunyusa ukusebenza kwe-poller. Idatha eninzi ipakishwa kwiphakhethi enye ye-SNMP nto leyo enokunciphisa ixesha lokusebenza kombuzo wedatha. Nangona kunjalo, ezinye izixhobo zinokwala ngokupheleleyo ukuphendula kwiiphakhethi ezinobungakanani be-max-repetition obukhulu kakhulu. Oku kunokuba yinyani ngakumbi kwizixhobo zohlobo lwe-IoT ezinamandla asezantsi okanye izixhobo ezincinci ze-IT ezidityanisiweyo. Ingqalelo ekhethekileyo kwi-MTU yomendo wonke wenethiwekhi nayo kufuneka ithathelwe ingqalelo ekubeni ukuseta ixabiso eliphezulu kakhulu kunokukhokelela ekuqhekekeni kweepakhethi."

