#: include/global_settings.php:436
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Indlela yeMvume yeGrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php:437
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Kukho iindlela ezine zokumisela iiMvume zeGrafu zoMsebenzisi.  Eyokuqala yi-'Permissive'.  Phantsi kwesetingi ye-'Permissive', uMsebenzisi ufuna kuphela ukufikelela kwiGrafu, iSixhobo okanye iTempleyithi yeGrafu ukuze afumane ukufikelela kwiiGrafu ezisebenza kuzo.  Phantsi kwe-'Restrictive', uMsebenzisi kufuneka afikelele kwiGrafu, iSixhobo, kunye neTempleyithi yeGrafu ukuze afumane ukufikelela kwiGrafu.  Ezi ndlela zimbini zokuqala zineengxaki zokukhula kwiifakelo ezinkulu kakhulu.  Ngoko ke, iinketho ezimbini ezongezelelweyo ziyafumaneka.  Ziyi-'Device Based', ethetha ukuba ukuba unokufikelela kwiSixhobo, ufumana ukufikelela kwiiGrafu zaso.  Kwaye okokugqibela i-'Graph Template Based', ethetha ukuba ukuba unokufikelela kwi-'Graph Template' ufumana ukufikelela kuzo zonke iiGrafu zeSixhobo zaloo Templeyithi."

#: include/global_settings.php:441
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Evumelayo (Permissive)"

#: include/global_settings.php:442
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Ethintelayo (Restrictive)"

#: include/global_settings.php:443
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "KuSekelwe kwiSixhobo"

