msgstr "Indlela yokuDala iGrafu/Umthombo weDatha"

#: include/global_settings.php:450
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Ukuba isetelwe ku-Simple, iiGrafu kunye neMithombo yeDatha zinokudalwa kuphela ukusuka kwi-New Graphs. Ukuba ngu-Advanced, ukudalwa kweeGrafu kunye neMithombo yeDatha yakudala kuyaxhaswa."

