msgstr "Ubude begrafu obumiselweyo obuya kusetyenziselwa zonke iiTempleyithi zeeGrafu ezitsha."

#: include/global_settings.php:622
msgid "The default Graph Width to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ububanzi begrafu obumiselweyo obuya kusetyenziselwa zonke iiTempleyithi zeeGrafu ezitsha."

