msgstr "I-Engine Id ye-SNMP v3 esisiseko kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha. Shiya le ndawo ingenanto ukuze usebenzise i-SNMP Engine ID echazwe ngokommamkeli weZaziso ze-SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php:782
