msgstr "I-UDP Port esisiseko kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha. Ngokuqhelekileyo ngu-161."

#: include/global_settings.php:791
msgid "Default SNMP timeout in milli-seconds for all new Devices."
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhelelwa kwe-SNMP elisisiseko ngee-milli-seconds kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha."

#: include/global_settings.php:799
msgid "Default SNMP retries for all new Devices."
msgstr "Imizamo kwakhona ye-SNMP esisiseko kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha."

#: include/global_settings.php:806
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Ukufumaneka/UkuFikeleleka"

#: include/global_settings.php:812
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Ukufumaneka/UkuFikeleleka okusisiseko kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha. Indlela i-Cacti eya kuyisebenzisa ukufumanisa ukuba iSixhobo siyafumaneka na kwi-polling. <br><i>QAPHELA: Kucetyiswa ukuba, ubuncinci, i-SNMP ihlale ikhethiwe.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php:818
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-Ping"

#: include/global_settings.php:819
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-Ping olusisiseko kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php:826
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "I-Ping Port esisiseko kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha. Nge-TCP, i-Cacti iya kuzama ukuthumela i-Syn kwizibuko. Nge-UDP, i-Cacti ifuna nokuba luqhagamshelo oluyimpumelelo, okanye imposiso ethi 'port not reachable' ukuze ibone ukuba iSixhobo sivukile na okanye hayi."

#: include/global_settings.php:834
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Ixabiso lokuPhelelwa koNxibelelwano lwe-Ping elisisiseko ngee-milli-seconds kuzo zonke iZixhobo ezitsha. Amaxabiso okuphelelwa kwexesha azakusetyenziselwa i-SNMP yeSixhobo, i-ICMP, i-UDP kunye ne-TCP pinging. Ii-ICMP Ping ziya kurawundwa ziye kumzuzwana osondeleyo. Ukuphelelwa kwexesha koqhagamshelo lwe-TCP ne-UDP kwi-Windows kulawulwa sisixokelelwano sokusebenza, kwaye ngoko ke akucetyiswa kwi-Windows."

#: include/global_settings.php:842
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Inani lamaxesha i-Cacti eya kuzama uku-ping isixhobo ngaphambi kokusiphawula njengesiphantsi."

#: include/global_settings.php:849
msgid "Up/Down Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi ze-Up/Down"

#: include/global_settings.php:854
msgid "Failure Count"
msgstr "Inani lokuSilela"

#: include/global_settings.php:855
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Inani lamaxesha okuqokelela isixhobo ekufuneka sibe phantsi ngaphambi kokurekhoda imposiso nokuxela isixhobo njengesiphantsi."

#: include/global_settings.php:862
msgid "Recovery Count"
msgstr "Inani lokuBuyisela"

#: include/global_settings.php:863
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Inani lamaxesha okuqokelela isixhobo ekufuneka sihlale siphezulu ngaphambi kokubuyisela isixhobo kwimeko ephezulu nokukhupha isaziso."

#: include/global_settings.php:872
msgid "Theme Settings"
