#: include/global_settings.php:1489
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Okusisiseko koMqokeleli weDatha"

#: include/global_settings.php:1490
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ezi setingi zigcinwa kwinqanaba loMqokeleli weDatha.  Amaxabiso apha angumiselweyo kuphela asetyenziswayo xa kuqala ukudalwa uMqokeleli weDatha."

#: include/global_settings.php:1495
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Iinkqubo zoMqokeleli weDatha"

#: include/global_settings.php:1496
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Inani elimiselweyo leenkqubo ezisebenzayo ngaxeshanye zokuqhuba kuMqokeleli weDatha ngamnye.  QAPHELA: Ukusukela kwi-Cacti 1.2, le setingi igcinwa kuMqokeleli weDatha.  Ukuya phambili, eli xabiso lisisicwangciso sangaphambili kuphela soMqokeleli weDatha.  Ukusebenzisa inani eliphezulu xa usebenzisa i-cmd.php kuya kuphucula ukusebenza.  Ukuphuculwa kokusebenza kwi-Spine kulungiswa ngcono ngepharamitha yee-thread.  Xa usebenzisa i-Spine, sicebisa inani eliphantsi kunye nokusebenzisa ii-thread endaweni yoko.  Xa usebenzisa i-cmd.php, ungasebenzisi ngaphezulu kwe-2x yenani lee-CPU cores."

#: include/global_settings.php:1503
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Ii-Thread ngeNkqubo nganye"

#: include/global_settings.php:1504
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ii-Thread ezimiselweyo ezivumelekileyo ngenkqubo nganye.  QAPHELA: Ukusukela kwi-Cacti 1.2+, le setingi igcinwa kuMqokeleli weDatha, kwaye oku sisicwangciso sangaphambili nje.  Ukusebenzisa inani eliphezulu xa usebenzisa i-Spine kuya kuphucula ukusebenza.  Nangona kunjalo, qinisekisa ukuba unoqhagamshelwano olwaneleyo lwe-MySQL/MariaDB ukuxhasa eli nxalenye: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  Kufuneka kwakhona uqinisekise ukuba unoqhagamshelwano olongezelelweyo olwaneleyo lokungena kwabasebenzisi."

#: include/global_settings.php:1518
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Indlela yoQinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php:1519
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Uqinisekiso oluKhelwe ngaphakathi</i> - I-Cacti ilawula uqinisekiso lomsebenzisi, okukuvumela ukuba uyile abasebenzisi kwaye ubanike amalungelo kwiindawo ezahlukeneyo ngaphakathi kwe-Cacti.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso oluSisiseko lweWebhu</i> - Uqinisekiso lulawulwa yiseva yewebhu. Abasebenzisi banokudityaniswa okanye bayilwe ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba uMsebenzisi weSakhelo uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zondwendwe ezichaziweyo.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP</i> - Luvumela uqinisekiso ngokuchasene neseva ye-LDAP. Abasebenzisi baya kuyilwa ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba uMsebenzisi weSakhelo uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zondwendwe ezichaziweyo. Ukuba imojuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP ayivulwanga, uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP aluyi kuvela njengokhetho olunokukhethwa.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lweDomeyini eNinzi ye-LDAP/AD</i> - Luvumela abalawuli ukuba baxhase amaqela amaninzi ahlukileyo avela kwizikhombisi ezahlukeneyo ze-LDAP/AD ukuze bafikelele kwizibonelelo ze-Cacti. Kanye njengoqinisekiso lwe-LDAP, imojuli ye-PHP LDAP iyafuneka ukusebenzisa le ndlela.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php:1525
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Xhasa ii-Cookie zoqinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php:1526
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Ukuba umsebenzisi uyangena aze akhethe u-'Keep me signed in', kuya kudala i-cookie yokuqinisekisa kwikhompyutha yomsebenzisi evumela loo msebenzisi ukuba ahlale engenile. I-cookie yokuqinisekisa iphelelwa emva kweentsuku ezingama-90 ingasetyenziswa."

#: include/global_settings.php:1531
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Abasebenzisi abakhethekileyo"

#: include/global_settings.php:1536
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "UMlawuli oyiNtloko"

#: include/global_settings.php:1537
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Igama le-akhawunti yomlawuli eyintloko eya kufumana ii-Imeyile ngokuzenzekelayo xa inkqubo ye-Cacti ifumana iingxaki.  Ukufumana ezi Imeyile, qinisekisa ukuba iisetingi zakho zemeyile zichanekile, kwaye i-akhawunti yomlawuli inedilesi ye-Imeyile esetiweyo."

