msgstr "Oku kuya kufuna ukuba onke amagama okugqitha amadala nawo ahlangabezane neemfuno ezintsha zokuntsonkotha xa kungena.  Ukuba akuhlangatyezwanga nazo, kuya kunyanzela utshintsho lwegama lokugqitha."

