#: include/global_settings.php:1688
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "I-akhawunti iya kuvulwa ngokuzenzekelayo emva kwale mizuzu mingaka. Nokuba igama lokugqitha elichanekileyo lifakiwe, i-akhawunti ayisayi kuvuleka kude kufikelelwe kulo mda wexesha. Elona xabiso liphezulu yimizuzu eyi-1440 (Usuku olu-1)"

