#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Ungene kuMqokeleli weDatha oKude. Xa uku-<b>'online'</b>, uya kukwazi ukujonga nokulawula uninzi lweWebhusayithi ePhambili ye-Cacti kanye ngokungathi ungene kuyo. Kwakhona, kubalulekile ukuba uqaphele ukuba abaQokeleli beDatha abaKude bayafuneka ukusebenzisa uphawu lwe-Cacti lweeNkonzo zokuKhulisa ukuSebenza oluthi <b>'On Demand Updating'</b>, kwaye sihlala sicebisa ukusebenzisa i-Spine. Xa uMqokeleli weDatha oKude eku-<b>'offline'</b>, iWebhusayithi yabaQokeleli beDatha abaKude iya kuba nolwazi oluncinci kakhulu. Nangona kunjalo, iya kugcina lonke uhlaziyo kude kube ngoku iSiseko seDatha ePhambili ye-Cacti kunye neSeva yeWebhu zifikeleleka. Emva koko iya kuthulula imveliso yetafile yayo ye-Boost ibuyele kwiSiseko seDatha ePhambili ye-Cacti ukuze ihlaziywe."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Akukho nanye kwiiPlagini eziPhambili ze-Cacti, ukuza kuthi ga ngoku, eyakhiwe ngokutsha ukuze isebenze nabaQokeleli beDatha abaKude. Ngoko ke, iiPlagini ezifana ne-MacTrack, ne-HMIB, ezifuna ufikelelo oluthe ngqo kwizixhobo azisayi kusebenza nabaQokeleli beDatha abaKude ngeli xesha. Nangona kunjalo, iiplagini ezifana ne-Thold ziya kusebenza ukuba nje uMqokeleli weDatha oKude ukwimo ye-<b>'online'</b>."

