#: lib/html_reports.php:157
msgid "e.g. If the Report Interval is 'Month(s)', then '2' indicates Every '2 Month(s) from the next Mailtime.' Lastly, if using the Month(s) Report Intervals, the 'Day of Week' and the 'Day of Month' are both calculated based upon the Mailtime you specify above."
msgstr "umz. Ukuba iXesha leNgxelo ngu-'Inyanga/Iinyanga', oko kuthetha ukuba u-'2' ubonisa Rhoqo emva kwe-'Iinyanga ezi-2 ukusukela kwi-Mailtime elandelayo.' Okokugqibela, ukuba usebenzisa iXesha leNgxelo le-'Inyanga/Iinyanga', u-'Usuku lweVeki' kunye no-'Usuku lweNyanga' zombini zibalwa ngokusekelwe kwi-Mailtime oyichaza ngasentla."

