#: lib/installer.php:2119
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yakho yokungena yesiseko sedatha ye-Cacti ayinakufikelela kwisiseko sedatha se-MySQL TimeZone.  Nceda unike i-akhawunti yesiseko sedatha ye-Cacti ukufikelela kwe-\"select\" kwitheyibhile ye-\"time_zone_name\" kwisiseko sedatha se-\"mysql\", kwaye uzalise ulwazi lwe-TimeZone ye-MySQL ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php:2124
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yakho yesiseko sedatha ye-Cacti inokufikelela kwisiseko sedatha se-MySQL TimeZone kwaye eso siseko sedatha sizaliswe ngolwazi lwe-TimeZone yehlabathi."

