msgstr "Phucula ukusuka ku-<strong>%s</strong> ukuya ku-<strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php:2169
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Kwimeko yeengxaki, kuyacetyiswa kakhulu ukuba ucime i-cache yebhrawuza yakho, uvale uze uvule kwakhona ibhrawuza yakho (hayi nje ithebhu ekuyo i-Cacti) kwaye uzame kwakhona, ngaphambi kokuphakamisa umba ne-The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php:2170
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Kwiimeko ezinqabileyo, siye safumana iingxelo ezivela kubasebenzisi abafumana iingxaki ezincinci ngenxa yotshintsho kwikhowudi. Ezi ngxaki zibangelwa yibhrawuza egcina ikhowudi yangaphambi kokuphuculwa kwaye nangona sithathe amanyathelo okunciphisa amathuba oku, kusenokwenzeka. Ukuba ufuna imiyalelo yokuba ucima njani i-cache yebhrawuza yakho, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> sisiqalo esihle."

#: lib/installer.php:2171
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Ukuba emva kokucima i-cache yakho kwaye uqalise kwakhona ibhrawuza yakho, usafumana iingxaki, nceda uphakamise umba kuthi kwaye siya kuzama ukuchonga unobangela wawo."

