msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Ubonakala ngathi uyehla ukuya kuguqulelo lwangaphambili.  Utshintsho lwesiseko sedatha olwenzelwe uguqulelo olutsha aluyi kubuyiselwa umva kwaye <i>kunokwenzeka</i> ludale iingxaki."

