#: lib/utility.php:1150
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "I-MySQL 5.6+ kunye ne-MariaDB 10.0+ zii-release ezintle kakhulu, kwaye zinguqulelo ezilungileyo kakhulu zokukhetha. Qinisekisa ukuba uqhuba eyona release intsha elungisa umba wenethiwekhi wenqanaba eliphantsi osele uthathe ixesha elide obubangela iingxaki ezininzi zokuthembeka kwi-spine."

#: lib/utility.php:1162
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "KUKHUTHAZWA KAKHULU ukuba uvule i-InnoDB kulo naluphi na uguqulelo lwe-%s olungaphezu kwe-5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php:1175 lib/utility.php:1212
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Xa usebenzisa i-Cacti ngeelwimi ezingezizo isiNgesi, kubalulekile ukusebenzisa uhlobo lokuhlanganisa lwe-utf8mb4_unicode_ci njengoko abanye oonobumba bethatha ngaphezulu kwe-byte enye."

#: lib/utility.php:1181 lib/utility.php:1187 lib/utility.php:1218
#: lib/utility.php:1224
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Xa usebenzisa i-Cacti ngeelwimi ezingezizo isiNgesi, kubalulekile ukusebenzisa iseti yoonobumba be-utf8mb4 njengoko abanye oonobumba bethatha ngaphezulu kwe-byte enye."

#: lib/utility.php:1200
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Kucetyiswa ukuba uvule i-InnoDB kulo naluphi na uguqulelo lwe-%s olungaphezu kwe-5.1."

#: lib/utility.php:1233
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Ngokuxhomekeke kwinani lokungena kunye nokusetyenziswa komqokeleli wedatha we-spine, i-%s iya kufuna uqhagamshelo oluninzi. Ubalo lwe-spine ngu: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), ngoko kufuneka ushiye isithuba soqhagamshelo lwabasebenzisi, oluya kutshintsha ngokuxhomekeke kwinani lee-akhawunti zokungena eziqhuba ngaxeshanye."

#: lib/utility.php:1238
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Ukugcina i-table cache inkulu kuthetha imisebenzi emincinci yokuvula/yokuvala ifayile xa usebenzisa i-innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php:1243
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Ngobuchule bokuqokelela obukude, isixa esikhulu sedatha siya kungqamaniswa ukusuka kweseva ephambili ukuya kwii-poller ezikude.  Ngoko ke, gcina eli xabiso liku-16M okanye ngaphezulu."

#: lib/utility.php:1249
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Ukuba usebenzisa i-Cacti Performance Booster kwaye ukhetha injini yokugcina yememori, kufuneka ulumke ukuze uhlambulule i-buffer yakho ye-Performance Booster ngaphambi kokuba inkqubo iphelelwe sisithuba setafile yememori. Oku kwenziwa ngeendlela ezimbini, okokuqala ukunciphisa ubungakanani bekholamu yakho yemveliso ibe bubungakanani obuchanekileyo. Le kholamu ikwiitafile poller_output, kunye ne-poller_output_boost. Into yesibini onokuyenza kukwabela imemori engakumbi kwiitafile zememori. Sikhethe ngokungakhethiyo ixabiso elicetyiswayo le-10%% yememori yenkqubo, kodwa ukuba usebenzisa ii-drive zediski ze-SSD, okanye unenkqubo encinci, ungasingahoyi esi cebiso okanye ukhethe injini yokugcina eyahlukileyo. Unokubona ukusetyenziswa okulindelekileyo kweetafile ze-Performance Booster phantsi kwe-Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php:1255
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Xa uqhuba ii-subquery, ukuba nobungakanani betheyibhile yexeshana obukhulu, kugcina ezo theyibhile zexeshana kwimemori."

#: lib/utility.php:1261 lib/utility.php:1267
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Xa usenza ii-join, ukuba zingaphantsi kolu bungakanani, ziya kugcinwa kwimemori kwaye aziyi kuze zibhalwe kwifayile yexeshana.  Njengoko oku kululwabiwo lwememori ngoqhagamshelwano ngalunye, kufuneka kuqatshelwe ukuba kunganyuswa kakhulu.  Isixa se-join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + imemori ye-Core MySQL/MariaDB kufuneka ibe ngaphantsi kwe-80%.  Ukuba isindululo asilunganga, kufuneka wehlise oku kunye/okanye i-sort_buffer_size de isindululo singene kwimemori evumelekileyo."

#: lib/utility.php:1273
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Xa usebenzisa ugcino lwe-InnoDB kubalulekile ukugcina izithuba zakho zeetheyibhile zihlukene.  Oku kwenza ukulawula iitheyibhile kube lula kubasebenzisi bexesha elide be-%s.  Ukuba ngoku usebenza oku kuvaliwe, ungafudukela kugcinelo lwefayile nganye ngokuvula eli nqaku, uze uqhube isitatimende se-alter kuzo zonke iitheyibhile ze-InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php:1279
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Xa usebenzisa i-innodb_file_per_table, kubalulekile ukuseta i-innodb_file_format kwi-Barracuda.  Le setingi iya kuvumela izalathiso ezide ezibalulekileyo kwiitheyibhile ezithile ze-Cacti."

#: lib/utility.php:1285
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Ukuba iitafile zakho zinee-index ezinkulu kakhulu, kufuneka usebenze nge-Barracuda innodb_file_format kunye ne-innodb_large_prefix elingana no-1. Ukusilela ukwenza oku kunokubangela ii-plugin zingakwazi ukudala iitafile ngokufanelekileyo."

#: lib/utility.php:1291
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "I-InnoDB iya kugcina iitafile ezininzi kunye nee-index ezininzi kwimemori yenkqubo kangangoko kunokwenzeka. Ngoko ke, kufuneka wenze i-innodb_buffer_pool ibe nkulu ngokwaneleyo ukuze ibambe uninzi lweetafile kunye ne-index kwimemori. Ukujonga ubungakanani bolawulo lwe-/var/lib/mysql/cacti kuya kunceda ekumiseleni eli xabiso. Sicebisa i-25%% yememori epheleleyo yenkqubo yakho, kodwa iimfuno zakho ziya kwahluka ngokuxhomekeke kubungakanani beenkqubo zakho."

#: lib/utility.php:1297
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Le setingi kufuneka ihlale i-ON ngaphandle kokuba i-Cacti yakho isebenza kwi-ZFS okanye kwi-FusionI/O zombini ezine-journaling yangaphakathi ukulungiselela ukuwa kwesixhobo ngesiquphe.  Nangona kunjalo, ukuba unombane olungileyo kakhulu, kwaye iinkqubo zakho zingayi phantsi rhoqo kwaye unee-backup, ukucima le setingi ibe yi-OFF kunokukunika ukonyuka phantse nge-50% ekusebenzeni kwesiseko sedatha."

#: lib/utility.php:1302
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Apha kulapho kugcinwa khona i-metadata. Ukuba uneetheyibhile ezininzi, kuya kuba luncedo ukonyusa oku."

#: lib/utility.php:1307
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Imibuzo ekhohlakeleyo akufunekanga ibangele isiseko sedatha singabikho kwi-intanethi kwabanye. Bulala le mibuzo ngaphambi kokuba ibulale inkqubo yakho."

#: lib/utility.php:1312
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Owona msebenzi uphezulu we-I/O wenzeka xa usebenzisa indlela ye-O_DIRECT ukuhlambulula amaphepha."

#: lib/utility.php:1322
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Ukusetela eli xabiso ku-2 kuthetha ukuba uya kukhupha zonke iintengiselwano rhoqo ngesekhondi nganye endaweni yokuba ube ngexesha lokuzibophelela.  Oku kuvumela i-%s ukuba ibhale kancinci."

#: lib/utility.php:1327
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Ngogcinelo lohlobo lwe-SSD lwanamhlanje, ukuba nee-io thread ezininzi kuluncedo kwii-aplikheyishini ezineempawu eziphezulu ze-io."

#: lib/utility.php:1335 lib/utility.php:1377
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Ukusukela nge-%s %s, unokulawula ukuba kangaphi i-%s ikhuphela iintengiselwano kwidiski. Okusisiseko ngumzuzwana o-1, kodwa kwiinkqubo ze-I/O eziphezulu ukusetela kwixabiso elikhulu kuno-1 kunokuvumela i-disk I/O ukuba ilandelelane ngakumbi"

#: lib/utility.php:1340
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Ngogcinelo lohlobo lwe-SSD lwanamhlanje, ukuba nee-read io thread ezininzi kuluncedo kwii-aplikheyishini ezineempawu eziphezulu ze-io.  Kuxhomekeke kuguqulelo lwakho lwe-MariaDB/MySQL, eli xabiso linganyuka liye kuthi ga ku-64.  Kodwa zama ukugcina inani lingaphantsi kwee-SMT thread zakho zizonke kweseva yesiseko sedatha."

#: lib/utility.php:1345
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Ngogcinelo lohlobo lwe-SSD lwanamhlanje, ukuba nee-write io thread ezininzi kuluncedo kwii-aplikheyishini ezineempawu eziphezulu ze-io.  Kuxhomekeke kuguqulelo lwakho lwe-MariaDB/MySQL, eli xabiso linganyuka liye kuthi ga ku-64.  Kodwa zama ukugcina inani lingaphantsi kwee-SMT thread zakho zizonke kweseva yesiseko sedatha."

#: lib/utility.php:1351
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s iya kwahlula i-innodb_buffer_pool kwimimandla yememori ukuze iphucule ukusebenza kwiinguqulelo ze-MariaDB ezingaphantsi kwe-10.5. Elona xabiso likhulu ngu-64, kodwa akufunekanga lidlule kwinani lee-CPU cores/threads. Xa i-innodb_buffer_pool yakho ingaphantsi kwe-1GB, kufuneka usebenzise ubungakanani be-pool bohlulwe nge-128MB. Qhubeka usebenzisa eli qhina ukuya kuthi ga kwinani eliphezulu lee-CPU cores okanye u-64."

#: lib/utility.php:1351
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s iya kwahlula i-innodb_buffer_pool kwimimandla yememori ukuze iphucule ukusebenza kwiinguqulelo ze-MySQL ukuya kuthi ga kwaye kuquka i-MySQL 8.0. Elona xabiso likhulu ngu-64, kodwa akufunekanga lidlule kwinani lee-CPU cores/threads. Xa i-innodb_buffer_pool yakho ingaphantsi kwe-1GB, kufuneka usebenzise ubungakanani be-pool bohlulwe nge-128MB. Qhubeka usebenzisa eli qhina ukuya kuthi ga kwinani eliphezulu lee-CPU cores okanye u-64."

#: lib/utility.php:1357 lib/utility.php:1393
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Ukuba unee-diski ze-SSD, sebenzisa eli cebiso. Ukuba unee-hard drive eziphathekayo, sebenzisa u-200 * inani lee-drive ezisebenzayo kwi-array. Ukuba usebenzisa i-NVMe okanye i-PCIe Flash, amanani amakhulu kakhulu afikelela ku-100000 angasetyenziswa."

#: lib/utility.php:1363 lib/utility.php:1399
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Ukuba unee-diski ze-SSD, sebenzisa eli cebiso. Ukuba unee-hard drive eziphathekayo, sebenzisa u-2000 * inani lee-drive ezisebenzayo kwi-array. Ukuba usebenzisa i-NVMe okanye i-PCIe Flash, amanani amakhulu kakhulu afikelela ku-200000 angasetyenziswa."

#: lib/utility.php:1369 lib/utility.php:1405
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
