#: utilities.php:2351
msgid "Cacti technical support page.  Used by developers and technical support persons to assist with issues in Cacti.  Includes checks for common configuration issues."
msgstr "Iphepha lenkxaso yobuchwepheshe ye-Cacti. Lisetyenziswa ngabaphuhlisi kunye nabasebenzi benkxaso yobuchwepheshe ukunceda ngeengxaki kwi-Cacti. Liquka uhlolo lwemiba eqhelekileyo yoqwalaselo."

#: utilities.php:2355
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Ilogi ye-Cacti igcina iinkcukacha-manani, iimposiso neminye imiyalezo ngokweesetingi zenkqubo.  Olu lwazi lunokusetyenziswa ukuchonga iingxaki kwi-poller nakwi-aplikheyishini."

#: utilities.php:2359
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Ivumela aBalawuli ukuba baphendle ilogi yomsebenzisi. Abalawuli banokuhluza kwaye bathumele ngaphandle ilogi kwakhona."

#: utilities.php:2363
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "ULawulo lwe-Cache ye-Poller"

#: utilities.php:2366
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Le yidatha edluliselwa kwi-poller ngalo lonke ixesha isebenza. Le datha iye iqhutywe/itolikwe kwaye iziphumo zifakwe kwii-RRDfile ukuze zenziwe igrafu okanye kwisiseko sedatha ukuze ziboniswe."

#: utilities.php:2370
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "I-Cache yoMbuzo weDatha igcina ulwazi oluqokelelwe kwiintlobo zegalelo loMbuzo weDatha. Amaxabiso avela kwezi ndawo angasetyenziswa kwindawo yombhalo yeeGrafu kwiincazelo, iiLebhile eziNkqonkqozayo, kunye ne-GPRINTS nakwi-CDEF."

#: utilities.php:2372
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Yakha kwakhona i-Cache ye-Poller"

#: utilities.php:2376
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "I-Poller Cache iya kuphinda iveliswe ukuba ukhetha olu khetho. Sebenzisa olu khetho kuphela xa kuthe kwakho ukonakala kwesiseko sedatha ukuba ufumana iingxaki emva kokonakala kwaye sele uqhube izixhobo zokulungisa isiseko sedatha.  Okanye, ukuba uneengxaki ngesixhobo esithile, vele ugcine kwakhona eso Sixhobo ukuze wakhe ngokutsha i-Poller Cache yaso.  Kukwakho nomyalelo we-CLI olingana nalo myalelo ocetyiswayo kwiinkqubo ezinkulu."

#: utilities.php:2378
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "QAPHELA: Kwiinkqubo ezinkulu, lo myalelo unokuthatha imizuzu emininzi ukuya kwiiyure ukugqiba kwaye ngoko ke akufunekanga uqhutywe kwi-UI ye-Cacti. Ungaqhuba nje 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' kumgca womyalelo ukuze ufumane ulwazi olungakumbi."

#: utilities.php:2382
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Yakha kwakhona i-Cache yeZixhobo"

#: utilities.php:2386
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Xa usebenzisa abaqokeleli bedatha abaninzi kwi-Cacti, i-Cacti iya kuzama ukugcina imeko yeefayile eziphambili kubo bonke abaqokeleli bedatha.  Oku kubandakanya zonke iifayile eziphambili, ezingezona ezofakelo zewebhusayithi nezee-plugin.  Xa unyanzela ukwakhiwa ngokutsha kwe-Resource Cache, i-Cacti iya kucima i-Resource Cache yasekuhlaleni, uze emva koko iyakhe ngokutsha ekuqaleni kwe-poller elandelayo ecwangcisiweyo.  Oku kuya kubangela bonke abaqokeleli bedatha abakude baphinde bahlole iifayile zabo zewebhusayithi nezee-plugin ukuba ziyahambelana na."

